                                "example_id": "b692d651-78b0-4918-bf56-5fb3540b07f2",
                                "sense_id": "51c788d2-90af-3ba6-9ccd-56c0bfe904a6",
                                "text": "He was speedily shown the way to such an emporium of intelligence, and soon found he was likely to hear all he desired to know, and much more, while his head was subjected to the art of a nimble tonsor."
